@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5146

### GET all students
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

###

### GET a single student by id — replace {id} with a real id from the response above
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/students/{id}
Accept: application/json

###

### POST — create a student (valid body -> 201 Created + Location header)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Naledi Mokoena",
  "learnerReferenceNumber": "LRN-2026-00391"
}

###

### POST — invalid body (blank name -> 400 Bad Request, thrown by Student's constructor)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "learnerReferenceNumber": "LRN-2026-00392"
}

###

### PUT — update a student's name -> 204 No Content. Replace {id} with a real id.
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/students/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Naledi N. Mokoena"
}

###

### DELETE a student -> 204 No Content the first time, 404 Not Found the second (idempotent).
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/students/{id}

###
